name: The Ox — hand money reset
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Ox sets money to $0 when you play your most played hand. Ante 6 boss: use a non-most-
  played hand or disable with Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheOx
    antes: [6]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Obelisk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
